<title>SPAIN: Santander appoints new fixed-income head.</title>
<headline>Santander appoints new fixed-income head.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Santander said in a statement late on Thursday that Robert Harding has joined Santander Investment as managing director responsible for global fixed income, derivatives and Treasury for Banco Santander and Santander Investment.</p>
<p>Harding was formerly managing director at UBS in London and senior vice president at UBS Switzerland responsible for fixed income and derivatives business in Europe.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 8340</p>
</text>
